## Stack Ringkas

```
Backend  : NestJS 10 + TypeScript strict
Frontend : Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript strict
DB       : PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM
Auth     : JWT (access 15m + refresh 7d httpOnly cookie)
UI       : shadcn/ui + TailwindCSS (dark maritime theme)
State    : Zustand (client) + React Query (server)
Test     : Jest (unit + integration) + Playwright (E2E)
```

---

## Arsitektur Ringkas

```
Domain Layer     ← Pure TypeScript, NO framework imports
Application Layer ← Use cases, CQRS commands/queries
Infrastructure   ← Prisma repos, external services
Presentation     ← NestJS controllers, Next.js pages
```

Dependency flow: `Presentation → Application → Domain ← Infrastructure`

